  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIn the Worlds, Avatars, Social and Groups Tab of the Main Menu you can use the small arrow button at the top to minimize the Navigation Panel on the left.\n\nMinimizing said Navigation Panel now results in a slight color change of the background of the Category buttons (e.g. Trending).\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe background color of these Category buttons should always stay the same.\n\n \n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/w8548n.mp4\n\n*P.S. have fun giving this to the UI Team pi :p*",
